              <comment>changes per 2010 compendium?</comment>
              <description>Rolls 1D6 to hit against the nearest facing armor value separately against every ship in range. This cannot be saved against by holofields. It rolls 4+ against every separate ordnance marker in range (as opposed to against ordnance waves).</description>
